---
// Gifts Component — registry, honeymoon fund, and charity
---

<div class="gifts-wrapper">
  <p class="gifts-intro">
    If you'd like to give something beyond your presence, we'd be grateful for
    any of the following.
  </p>

  <div class="gifts-category">
    <h3 class="gifts-cat-title">Registry</h3>
    <div class="gifts-item">
      <p>
        We've put together a registry of things we'd love for our home together.
      </p>
      <a
        class="gifts-button"
        href="https://www.myregistry.com/giftlist/calebgrace"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >
        View our registry
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="gifts-category">
    <h3 class="gifts-cat-title">Honeymoon Fund</h3>
    <div class="gifts-item">
      <p>
        If you'd prefer to help us celebrate on our honeymoon, you can make a
        contribution through either of the links below. We'll try to send you a
        photo of the thing we spent it on.
      </p>
      <div class="gifts-button-row">
        <a
          class="gifts-button"
          href="https://monzo.me/calebparikh?h=xoojOF&account_type=joint"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          UK &bull; Monzo
        </a>
        <a
          class="gifts-button"
          href="https://venmo.com/u/calebparikh"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          US &bull; Venmo @calebparikh
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="gifts-category">
    <h3 class="gifts-cat-title">Charity</h3>
    <p class="gifts-item-lead">
      Giving well is close to both our hearts. In lieu of a gift, you might
      consider donating to one of two causes we've set up fundraisers for.
    </p>

    <div class="gifts-charity">
      <h4>AI Safety Advocacy</h4>
      <p>
        The Midas Project and Legal Advocates for Safe Science and Technology
        (LAAST) push for accountability from AI companies.
      </p>
      <a
        class="gifts-button"
        href="https://www.every.org/make-sure-ai-benefits"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >
        Donate
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="gifts-charity">
      <h4>Global Health &amp; Effective Giving</h4>
      <p>
        Giving What We Can and Ambitious Impact are building a culture of giving
        to and founding high-impact charities, particulary for people in poverty
        and factory farmed animals. Grace is a Giving What We Can pledger and
        Caleb founded a charity through Ambitious Impact.
      </p>
      <a
        class="gifts-button"
        href="https://www.every.org/empower-radically-ambitious"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >
        Donate
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .gifts-wrapper {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .gifts-intro {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: #555;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0 0 2.5rem 0;
    font-style: italic;
    border-left: 3px solid #ddd;
    padding-left: 1rem;
  }

  .gifts-category {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    border-left: 3px solid #111;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }

  .gifts-category:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .gifts-cat-title {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem 0;
    color: #111;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .gifts-item p {
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem 0;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #444;
  }

  .gifts-item-lead {
    margin: 0 0 1.75rem 0;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #444;
  }

  .gifts-charity {
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
    padding-bottom: 1.75rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
  }

  .gifts-charity:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
    padding-bottom: 0;
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .gifts-charity h4 {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
    color: #111;
  }

  .gifts-charity p {
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem 0;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #444;
  }

  .gifts-button-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .gifts-button {
    display: inline-block;
    border: 2px solid #111;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-variant: small-caps;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: #111;
    background-color: transparent;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition:
      background-color 0.2s ease,
      color 0.2s ease,
      border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .gifts-button:hover {
    background-color: #111;
    border-color: #111;
    color: #fffff8;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .gifts-category {
      padding-left: 1rem;
    }

    .gifts-button-row {
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .gifts-button {
      text-align: center;
    }
  }
</style>
